y":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"复现方法：\n\n```\npython-project/\n├── a.py   (12 bytes)\n├── b.py    (128 bytes)\n└── data.json  (7 MB，大文件)\n```\n\n在 vscode 中打开 a, b 文件时正常，但是一旦打开 data.json **大文件（7MB+）** 后，然后在 a, b, data 文件标签页切换时，就会造成 vscode 左侧栏 “源代码管理” 状态更新极其缓慢，这个过程至少需要 10 ~ 60s ，同时会阻塞其它插件的正常工作（如：对某个变量右键点击“查找所有引用”按钮），直至侧栏 “源代码管理” 中的状态更新完成。即使没有对相关文件进行内容修改，仅切换不同文件的标签，也会触发上述问题。\n\n尝试过配置 `.gitignore` 和 `.codegeexignore` 来忽略相关文件，也尝试过在 codegeex 设置中忽略 json 语言的补全，但均没有效果。","closed_by":{"login":"brianler","id":26024884,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDI0ODg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26024884?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brianler","html_url":"https://github.com/brianler","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brianler/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brianler/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brianler/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brianler/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brianler/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brianler/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brianler/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brianler/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brianler/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX4/issues/91/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX4/issues/91/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null},"comments":[]}